{"page":469,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:17","surah":40,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ تُجْزَىٰ كُلُّ نَفْسٍۭ بِمَا كَسَبَتْ ۚ لَا ظُلْمَ ٱلْيَوْمَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَرِيعُ ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Today each soul will be rewarded for whatever it has done; today no injustice will be done. God is swift in reckoning.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"This Day","transliteration":"al-yawma","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُجْزَىٰ","en_gloss":"will be recompensed","transliteration":"tuj'zā","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَفْسٍۭ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَسَبَتْ ۚ","en_gloss":"it earned","transliteration":"kasabat","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"No","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ظُلْمَ","en_gloss":"injustice","transliteration":"ẓul'ma","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ ۚ","en_gloss":"today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سَرِيعُ","en_gloss":"(is) Swift","transliteration":"sarīʿu","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_gloss":"(in) Account","transliteration":"l-ḥisābi","verse_key":"40:17"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:17"}]},{"verse_key":"40:18","surah":40,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَنذِرْهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْـَٔازِفَةِ إِذِ ٱلْقُلُوبُ لَدَى ٱلْحَنَاجِرِ كَـٰظِمِينَ ۚ مَا لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ مِنْ حَمِيمٍ وَلَا شَفِيعٍ يُطَاعُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Warn them [Prophet] of the ever-approaching Day, when hearts are at throats, choking them. The evildoer will have no friends, 